(Transcribed by TurboScribe. Go Unlimited to remove this message.) Mr. Ramirez wanted his students to feel comfortable

2
00:00:03,320 --> 00:00:04,140
in class.

3
00:00:05,080 --> 00:00:06,940
That was his number one goal.

4
00:00:07,720 --> 00:00:09,760
He felt like he was doing a good

5
00:00:09,760 --> 00:00:10,260
job.

6
00:00:11,120 --> 00:00:12,700
There was one quiet student.

7
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:14,700
He had no friends.

8
00:00:15,460 --> 00:00:17,660
He did not do class presentations.

9
00:00:18,660 --> 00:00:20,500
He never raised his hand.

10
00:00:21,220 --> 00:00:22,460
His name was Brandon.

11
00:00:23,520 --> 00:00:25,500
Everyone called him QB.

12
00:00:26,360 --> 00:00:28,380
It stands for Quiet Boy.

13
00:00:29,340 --> 00:00:32,360
Mr. Ramirez just wanted to see him smile.

14
00:00:33,140 --> 00:00:34,820
He tried telling him a joke.

15
00:00:35,780 --> 00:00:37,160
QB did not laugh.

16
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,200
He just continued reading his book.

17
00:00:41,120 --> 00:00:43,900
Mr. Ramirez tried telling a funny story.

18
00:00:44,880 --> 00:00:46,640
QB did not laugh.

19
00:00:47,700 --> 00:00:50,340
Mr. Ramirez showed his pretty paintings.

20
00:00:51,400 --> 00:00:52,480
QB smiled.

21
00:00:53,400 --> 00:00:55,440
Mr. Ramirez was happy.

22
00:00:56,100 --> 00:00:59,940
He found out that QB has artistic talents.
